    // TC: 313179b-TC-025
    // Verify that last measurement retrieval does not expose boolean measurement values as numeric or vice versa (type safety).
    // NOTE: The endpoint /api/orders/last-measurement requires authentication as a SHOP_OWNER (the @PreAuthorize on the
    // controller declares "hasRole('SHOP_OWNER')"). The API surface does not expose an auth flow that produces such a
    // token deterministically for an arbitrary test run (signin requires pre-existing credentials that are not seeded),
    // so the precondition cannot be built from the listed endpoints. Per the rules, this case is OMITTED rather than
    // built against a hardcoded id that returns 404, which would test nothing about the rule under examination.
    @Test
    public void lastMeasurementTypeSafety() {
        Assert.fail("Cannot be automated: endpoint requires SHOP_OWNER auth which is not reachable from the listed endpoints.");
    }

